  "markdown_content": "## Financial Results Highlights\\nICICI Bank has released its fourth quarter results for the financial year 2025, showcasing strong performance with an 18% year-over-year increase in profit. The private sector lender demonstrated robust growth across key parameters including Net Interest Income (NII) and deposit base.\\n\\n## Shareholder Returns\\nThe bank has also announced its dividend for 2025, which stands as the highest cash reward to shareholders in the past decade, highlighting the bank's strong financial position and commitment to shareholder value.\\n\\n## Market Impact\\nThe announcement comes amid positive market sentiment, with the broader market indices showing upward momentum. The results and dividend declaration are expected to influence market dynamics in the banking sector.",
